                                                "sense_id": "32b5dc0c-0ca3-3b33-8eec-b1ca1fd5be3e",
                                                "text": "The chicken chain’s parent company, Yum Brands, announced Tuesday that KFC’s corporate headquarters is leaving Kentucky for Texas, joining sister brand Pizza Hut’s offices in the Dallas suburb of Plano."
